n it incorporates both the known equation for an infinitely massive Brownian particle and the classical linear Boltzmann equation as limiting cases.", "abstract_source_suggest": {"input": "arXiv"}}], "primary_arxiv_category": ["quant-ph"], "titles": [{"source": "arXiv", "title": "Master equation for a quantum particle in a gas"}], "facet_author_name": ["1073918_Klaus Hornberger"], "_oai": {"sets": ["Literature"], "id": "oai:inspirehep.net:2981340", "updated": "2026-02-09T14:59:09.441013"}, "curated": false, "journal_title_variants": ["Phys.Rev.Lett.", "Phys. Rev. Lett."], "arxiv_eprints": [{"categories": ["quant-ph"], "value": "quant-ph/0607085"}]}}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.97.060601&size=5&page=1", "bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.97.060601&size=5&page=1&format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.97.060601&size=5&page=1&format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.97.060601&size=5&page=1&format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.97.060601&size=5&page=1&format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.97.060601&size=5&page=1&format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.97.060601&size=5&page=1&format=cv"}}